 "remarks": "Calling all house-hackers and investors! This two-family offers exactly what you've been looking for: a fully renovated unit to live in (or rent at top dollar) plus a second unit delivering immediate cash flow with future upside. Unit 1 was redone with a buyer's eye for finishes. The kitchen features white shaker cabinetry, quartz counters, subway tile backsplash, black hardware and a full stainless LG appliance package with gas range. Refinished hardwood floors, recessed lighting and neutral paint run throughout. The spa-style bath includes marble-look tile, a wood vanity and illuminated mirror, plus its own in-unit stacked washer/dryer. Move in and enjoy, or rent for premium income. Unit 2 occupied and in great shape with classic oak cabinetry, its own laundry area, and a private covered porch. Currently tenant-occupied for immediate rental income, with clear upside for an owner ready to renovate down the road.",
